# What the intel team worker needs beyond the standard library: matplotlib,
# to draw the report's charts. It installs into its own environment
# (venv-team), so the dashboard and the collector's workers never load it.
# The two constraint files keep any package this lock shares with the others
# at the same version, so CI can install all three together.
#
#   uv pip compile requirements-team.in --universal --generate-hashes \
#     --python-version 3.12 -o requirements-team.txt
-c requirements.txt
-c requirements-dev.txt
matplotlib>=3.10
